stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Anonymous
  Anonymous --> Authenticating: login
  Authenticating --> Authenticated: login succeeded
  Authenticating --> Anonymous: login failed
  Authenticated --> Authenticated: request ok
  Authenticated --> Refreshing: request401 (primera de varias simultaneas)
  Refreshing --> Refreshing: request401 adicional (se acumula, no dispara otra renovacion)
  Refreshing --> Authenticated: refreshSucceeded (reintenta solicitudes acumuladas)
  Refreshing --> Anonymous: refreshFailed (token y sesion se limpian)
  Authenticated --> Anonymous: logout